hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1713","Narrated to us Ahmad ibn Mani' — Narrated to us Hushaym — He informed us Ya'la ibn 'Ata' — Jabir ibn Yazid ibn al-Aswad al-'Amiri narrated to us — on the authority of his father who said:

""I witnessed the Hajj of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) with him. I prayed the Fajr prayer with him in the Masjid al-Khayf. When he completed his prayer and turned away, he saw two men at the end of the congregation.""

**CHAPTER:**"
